      "expected": "#ERROR!",
      "category": "invalid-syntax",
      "source": "engine-contract",
      "notes": "The parser never checks that every token was consumed, so it returns the first expression and silently discards the rest. Whole classes of typos become silent wrong answers instead of errors.",
